      en: ["The plateau covers an area of several tens of thousands of square kilometers.", "The geological layers consist mainly of sandstone from the Karoo Supergroup.", "The Kwango River is a left tributary of the Kasai River.", "The average annual rainfall ranges between 1,200 and 1,600 mm.", "The Yaka Kingdom was founded in the 16th century in this region.", "The altitude of the plateau varies between 500 and 1000 meters."],
      es: ["Superficie: aprox. 150.000 km²", "Altitud: 800–1000 m", "Río principal: Kwango (Longitud: aprox. 1.200 km)", "Base geológica: Rocas precámbricas", "Tipo de suelo: Laterita", "Principales cultivos: Yuca, maíz, cacahuete"],
      pt: ["Área: aprox. 150.000 km²", "Altitude: 800–1000 m", "Rio principal: Kwango (Comprimento: aprox. 1.200 km)", "Base geológica: Rochas pré-câmbricas", "Tipo de solo: Laterite", "Principais culturas: Mandioca, milho, amendoim"],
      fr: ["Superficie : env. 150 000 km²", "Altitude : 800–1000 m", "Rivière principale : Kwango (Longueur : env. 1 200 km)", "Base géologique : Roches précambriennes", "Type de sol : Latérite", "Principales cultures : Manioc, maïs, arachide"],
